{"product":{"id":8077684539470,"title":"Everyday Fresh Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis set brings together three versatile fresh signatures — a smooth citrusy woody fragrance, a crisp spicy-aromatic scent, and a fresh modern composition with a refined woody base. Three miniatures designed for effortless everyday wear, from the office to casual outings.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHamdan The Sheikh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is bergamot, mandarin, and elemi over sandalwood, amber, cedar, and patchouli, settling into olibanum, tonka bean, musk, and vanilla — smooth, warm, and sophisticated.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKuro\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is geranium and bergamot over lavender, pepper, and elemi, settling into ambergris, patchouli, and vetiver — fresh, spicy, and confidently masculine.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eModest Une\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is Calabrian bergamot, pepper, and lavender over pink pepper, geranium, and elemi, settling into ambroxan, vetiver, and patchouli — crisp, aromatic, and effortlessly refined.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree everyday fresh signatures, one exceptional set — the perfect way to discover your next daily fragrance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-17T17:55:09+05:30","handle":"everyday-fresh-sample-set-hamdan-the-sheikh-